{"4568330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curse Of The Abandoned Floor", "steam_appid": 4568330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4825100], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curse Of The Abandoned Floor</strong> is a first-person Chinese-style horror game set in a modern urban backdrop. In this game, a once warm and ordinary daily life is turned upside down by a sudden elevator malfunction. On the abandoned floors, things that should not exist begin to stir…</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Interactive Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a first-person perspective and lifelike visuals, the game delivers a deeply immersive experience. Many of the environments are faithfully recreated from real-life locations, greatly enhancing the sense of immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568330/extras/fb8d7da1e212de5557bf7bca168e7e00.poster.avif?t=1785589914\" width=1170 height=698 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568330/extras/fb8d7da1e212de5557bf7bca168e7e00.webm?t=1785589914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568330/extras/fb8d7da1e212de5557bf7bca168e7e00.mp4?t=1785589914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pervasive Erosion of Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cozy, everyday living environment is no longer safe. Terrifying presences can emerge from anywhere—perhaps just a casual turn of your head, and you’ll find it standing right beside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568330/extras/2c3ccce613b75e7271388ef60e25d0db.poster.avif?t=1785589914\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568330/extras/2c3ccce613b75e7271388ef60e25d0db.webm?t=1785589914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568330/extras/2c3ccce613b75e7271388ef60e25d0db.mp4?t=1785589914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carefully Designed Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have crafted thrilling gameplay experiences for you. When it’s searching for you, hold your breath—any mistake will drag you into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568330/extras/5fc2432266d23ea3d861f925577850bd.poster.avif?t=1785589914\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568330/extras/5fc2432266d23ea3d861f925577850bd.webm?t=1785589914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568330/extras/5fc2432266d23ea3d861f925577850bd.mp4?t=1785589914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Hidden Dark Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you will gradually uncover the dark truth lurking behind it all. Whether you choose to run or fight back, the decision is entirely yours.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568330/extras/3261e9f1533d2e6b03fb296a4d4f474e.poster.avif?t=1785589914\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568330/extras/3261e9